  "description": "Seo Jihyeok is the unstoppable spear. Park Seongyeon is the impenetrable shield. And everyone on campus knows they're a match made in hell. Seongyeon is sick and tired of Jihyeok’s endless, shameless flirting. He just wants peace, but fate has other plans when he ends up dragging a drunk Jihyeok back to his place. When Jihyeok suddenly crosses the line and touches him, Seongyeon doesn't hesitate to throw a punch. But instead of backing down, the blow only lights a dangerous fire in Jihyeok's eyes. Realizing he's dealing with a literal lunatic, Seongyeon feels his perfect control slipping. Can the ultimate shield survive a spear that refuses to miss?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
